flowchart TD

%% Agentic RAG flow aligned to ScholarSync codebase
%% - Studio: apps api routes studio -> StudioService -> Pinecone context -> model routing -> output (plus DALL E for infographic)
%% - Chat: apps api routes chat -> RAGService -> guardrails -> cache and memory -> retrieval agents -> citations -> stream answer -> output guardrails -> eval signals

A[User input or Studio click] --> B[Tenant and Auth middleware]
B --> C{Studio or Chat}

%% ---------------- STUDIO ----------------
subgraph STUDIO
  C -->|Studio| S0[Studio endpoint POST studio generate]
  S0 --> S1[Planner and Router agent for Studio
  choose task type from button]
  S1 --> S2[Retriever agent for Studio
  fetch context from Pinecone by source ids]
  S2 --> S3{Task agent type}

  S3 -->|Quiz Flashcards Mindmap Slide deck| S4[Model selector agent
  OpenAI gpt 4o mini]
  S3 -->|Report Infographic| S5[Model selector agent
  Gemini default with OpenAI fallback]

  S4 --> S6[Response generator agent
  LLM generate]
  S5 --> S6

  S6 --> S7{Infographic}
  S7 -->|Yes| S8[Tool agent DALL E image generation]
  S7 -->|No| S9[Return Studio JSON]
  S8 --> S9
end

%% ---------------- CHAT (RAG) ----------------
subgraph CHAT
  C -->|Chat| R0[Chat endpoint POST chat stream]
  R0 --> R1[Controller and Planner agent
  route to RAG pipeline]

  R1 --> G0[Moderation input agent
  PII then Injection then Intent gate then Safety]
  G0 -->|Blocked| X[Refusal]
  G0 -->|Allowed| M0[Memory agent
  cold start then prune then summarize]

  M0 --> C0{Answer cache agent hit}
  C0 -->|Yes| C1[Return cached answer and citations]
  C0 -->|No| Q0[Query rewrite agent
  rewrite and narrow scope]

  Q0 --> R2[Retriever agent
  Pinecone vector plus keyword hybrid]
  R2 --> R3[Reranker agent and MMR diversity agent]
  R3 --> R4[Context selector agent
  dedupe and token budget]

  R4 --> T0{Two stage grounding}
  T0 -->|Yes| T1[Source grounding agent
  answerable with mini context]
  T0 -->|No| L0[Response generator agent
  LLM stream generate]
  T1 --> L0

  L0 --> O0[Output agents
  early stop length limiter citation checks]
  O0 --> G1[Moderation output agent
  safety then PII redact]
  G1 --> E0[Evaluator agent
  confidence scoring and done flags]
  E0 --> D0[Done SSE event]
end

%% Final join
C1 --> Z[Final output]
D0 --> Z
S9 --> Z
X --> Z